{"3846780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Virtual Buddy", "steam_appid": 3846780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👋 The Virtual Buddy – Bring Your Desktop to Life!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎉 <strong>Now in Early Access!</strong><br>The Virtual Buddy is still growing — but your digital friend just couldn’t wait any longer! Jump in now and help shape the future together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💬 What is The Virtual Buddy?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Virtual Buddy is a <strong>desktop companion simulation</strong> where a digital friend lives on your screen alongside you.<br>Sometimes hungry, sometimes sleepy, sometimes just looking for attention...<br>But always wants to be with you. 🧡</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They walk around, relax, respond to your interaction, and occasionally surprise you with unexpected behavior.<br>Whether you're working, gaming, or watching videos — your digital friend is always there in the corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846780/extras/41c6f59364e0435a69eb76b16e1dbce4.avif?t=1764797433\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846780/extras_big/41c6f59364e0435a69eb76b16e1dbce4.avif?t=1764797433 width=800 height=800 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔑 Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Interaction Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match with your Steam friend and see their pet on your screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send quick messages with a single tap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share small gestures of affection with heart sends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave a fun little “bathroom surprise” on your friend’s screen. 💩</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Real-Time Need System</strong><br>Your buddy has needs: hunger, thirst, energy, mood, health, and <strong>toilet</strong>.<br>It needs your attention — just like a real friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Mini Games</strong><br>Want to have some fun? Play light, enjoyable mini games with your companion and brighten your screen time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖱️ <strong>Drag &amp; Drop Interaction</strong><br>Move your buddy anywhere on your screen. Place items like food bowls, toys, and beds wherever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎁 <strong>Accessories &amp; Decorations</strong><br>Customize your space with fun items to make your desktop feel more alive and personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌈 <strong>Different Styles &amp; Characters</strong><br>From the very beginning, choose between unique companions — each with their own looks, vibes, and personalities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚧 Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📌 New Buddies<br>📌 More Mini Games<br>📌 Events &amp; Tasks<br>📌 Decoration Expansions<br>📌 Social Features<br>📌 Customization &amp; Mod Support<br>📌 Steam Achievements &amp; Collections</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👋 The Virtual Buddy – Bring Your Desktop to Life!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎉 <strong>Now in Early Access!</strong><br>The Virtual Buddy is still growing — but your digital friend just couldn’t wait any longer! Jump in now and help shape the future together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💬 What is The Virtual Buddy?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Virtual Buddy is a <strong>desktop companion simulation</strong> where a digital friend lives on your screen alongside you.<br>Sometimes hungry, sometimes sleepy, sometimes just looking for attention...<br>But always wants to be with you. 🧡</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They walk around, relax, respond to your interaction, and occasionally surprise you with unexpected behavior.<br>Whether you're 